给出做多BTC做空ETH的策略，今年4.8日市场到底的那天，也给出了反转的看法。 https://t.co/DDojYP3kSQ","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/1920459267322028084"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"1920443316983738410","created_at":"2025-05-08T11:39:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1920443316983738410"],"id":"1920443316983738410","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":333,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"今年的2大加密叙事，RWA和支付，本质是帮美国化债，1个利好以太坊，1个利好TRX","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/1920443316983738410"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"1920350676514967702","created_at":"2025-05-08T05:30:54.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1920350676514967702"],"id":"1920350676514967702","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":537,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"1920093944941347161","type":"quoted"}],"text":"这个贴子很有意思，之前思考过：I人没有E人适合微博、推特这套语境，下面的数据证实了这点，前20只有2个I人。\n微博和推特的语境是把人摆在台面，让大家看热闹，这不太符合I人的性格特性。I相较于E对于自己言论结果的有效性更看重，所以会减少发言的频率。而之前的公众号时代是I人的天下。 https://t.co/BWeRvpRkD0","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/1920350676514967702"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"1909436120024457375","created_at":"2025-04-08T02:40:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1909436120024457375"],"id":"1909436120024457375","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9696,"like_count":1,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"这轮关税黑天鹅后，加密货币市场的风险接近尾声，ETH昨天跌破1500探到1411的那一刻就是底部，SOL探到95，也进入到了80-100底部区间。","url":"https://x.com/Mcfly2140/status/1909436120024457375"},{"author_id":"928496628570427392","conversation_id":"1909435457953546352","created_at":"2025-04-08T02:37:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1909435457953546352"],"id":"1909435457953546352","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1298,"like_count":1,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"refe